creature SpaceStation
  traits
    oxygen_level is a number
    power_level is a number
  end traits

  when born
    give self the trait oxygen_level to 100
    give self the trait power_level to 100
  end born

  action consume_resources
    give self the trait oxygen_level to self oxygen_level - 10
    give self the trait power_level to self power_level - 15
    say "Resources consumed. Oxygen: " + self oxygen_level + "%, Power: " + self power_level + "%"
    
    when self oxygen_level < 20
      say "WARNING: Oxygen levels critically low!"
    end when
    
    when self power_level < 20
      say "WARNING: Power levels critically low!"
    end when
  end action

  action run_generator
    give self the trait power_level to self power_level + 30
    say "Generator ran. Power increased to " + self power_level + "%"
  end action

  action run_scrubber
    give self the trait oxygen_level to self oxygen_level + 20
    say "Oxygen scrubber ran. Oxygen increased to " + self oxygen_level + "%"
  end action
end creature

bring ISS to life as SpaceStation

ISS does consume_resources
ISS does consume_resources
ISS does consume_resources
ISS does run_generator
ISS does run_scrubber
ISS does consume_resources
